desk_emu.c, desk_emu.h, emu_pump.h and netns.h are libdiginet's test doubles, copied unchanged
from https://github.com/FreeMixer/libdiginet tests/ at f3a78df (the 0.1.4 release:
a Control|24 comes online on its a0 and owes an e2 on the next e0, FreeMixer/libdiginet#48). libdiginet installs no test code, and the DigiNet module's tests need
its desk emulator against an installed libdiginet too. tests/diginet/emu-sync-check.sh holds the
copies to a libdiginet tree given in DIGINET_SRC; update them together, from one libdiginet
commit.
